{'symbol': 'FMC', 'date': '2022-05-10 16:32:00', 'title': 'FMC CORPORATION OBTAINS PRE-SUIT INJUNCTION IN CHINA FOR PATENT INFRINGEMENT', 'text': "PHILADELPHIA , MAY 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 FMC CORPORATION (NYSE: FMC), A LEADING GLOBAL AGRICULTURAL SCIENCES COMPANY, ANNOUNCED THE NINGBO INTERMEDIATE PEOPLE'S COURT IN ZHEJIANG PROVINCE, CHINA, GRANTED FMC AGRO SINGAPORE PTE. LTD A PRE-SUIT PRELIMINARY INJUNCTION TO STOP INFRINGEMENT OF A CHLORANTRANILIPROLE PATENT."}